[TITLE]
ValveWise OWA-EPANET Test Network - Topology from User Diagram (Image 3)
Topology:
  R1 (Reservoir) -> PUMP -> J1
  J1 -> P2 -> T1 (Storage Tank)
  J1 -> P1 -> J2 (Junction)
  J1 -> P3 -> J3 (Junction)
  J2 -> P4 -> J3 (Junction)

