;ID              Elev         Demand       Pattern
J1               100.0        0.0          ; Junction 1 (Hub)
J2               90.0         15.0         ; Junction 2 (Consumer Zone A)
J3               95.0         20.0         ; Junction 3 (Consumer Zone B)

